<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The lead&nbsp; {!Lead.Name} from {!Lead.Company}&nbsp;</font><font style="">assigned to you or accepted by you has not been updated to the status of Accepted, Passed to Partner, or Rejected within the specified SLA.</font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Click&nbsp;<a href="{!Lead.Link}">here</a><a href="https://intel.my.salesforce.com//p/email/template/EmailTemplateEditorUi/{!Lead.Link}" style="">&nbsp;</a>to visit this lead record in SFDC</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">As a reminder, the following SLA’s are expected for any TQL lead:&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">LDR must schedule 1-on-1 connect with relevant Sales Rep within 1 business day of &lt;Entrance Date – TQL.&gt; The meeting itself does not need to be within 1 business day, however it is encouraged to be as close as possible, barring schedules.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please disposition your lead by scheduling this 1-on-1 with the relevant sales rep, and reassign the lead to the appropriate Sales Rep as required.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you, please refer to&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://salescrm.intel.com/training-and-help/lead-management/">this document</a></span></font><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;if you have questions regarding how to manage any lead assigned to you or claimed by you.</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">&nbsp;</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>